hu-054-recluses-complete:p014:m0108","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p014:m0108"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":3,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":3,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":2,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"3處獨立位置，3個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:source_review13-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"z7a_nhg_u1e","source_quote":"　　是時員外郎劉思效表陳讜言曰：「宋自大明以來，漸見凋弊，徵賦有增於往，天府尤貧於昔。兼軍警屢興，傷夷不復，戍役殘丁，儲無半菽，小民嗷嗷，無樂生之色。貴勢之流，貨室之族，車服伎樂，爭相奢麗，亭池第宅，競趣高華。至於山澤之人，不敢採飲其水草。貧富相輝，捐源尚末。陛下宜發明詔，吐德音，布惠澤，禁邪偽，薄賦斂，省傜役，絕奇麗之賂，塞鄭、衞之倡，變曆運之化，應質文之用，不亦大哉！又彭、汴有鴟梟之巢，青丘爲狐兔之窟，虐害踰紀，殘暴日滋。鬼泣舊泉，人悲故壤，童孺視編髮而慚生，耆老看左衽而恥沒。陛下宜仰答天人引領之望，下弔甿黎傾首之勤，授鉞衞、霍之將，遺策蕭、張之師，萬道俱前，窮山蕩谷。此卽恒山不足指而傾，渤海不足飲而竭，豈徒殘寇塵滅而已哉！」","reading":"劉思效以員外郎上表，其議論與顧歡表後同有詔答。","note":"劉思效以員外郎上表，其議論與顧歡表後同有詔答。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p013","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":319,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:variant_review13-4","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"z7a_nhg_u1e","source_quote":"員外郎劉思效表陳讜言","reading":"劉思效長表與顧歡互補，同有第52行詔答。此處是文書見證，無獨立生平附傳。","note":"劉思效長表與顧歡互補，同有第52行詔答。此處是文書見證，無獨立生平附傳。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p013","start_codepoint":4,"end_codepoint":14,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","source_